e character has long, dark, wavy hair flowing naturally in the breeze. They are wearing a brown plaid jacket and have a thin gold chain-style shoulder strap visible. The background shows a bright blue sky with scattered white clouds, along with people walking outdoors in casual attire. A rooftop setting is implied, with a distant view of city structures and open space."], "请把这个段文本，按照下面这个格式放松描写出来。\n文本：收藏娃娃\n女性长发微卷，穿灰色背心搭配浅蓝色破洞牛仔裤，手持报纸覆盖胸前，搭配银色手镯，背景为厨房，有酒瓶等道具。\n格式：\n图片展示了一个名为“艾米丽”的迷人收藏娃娃，包装在一个类似展示柜的盒子里。镂空提手，艾米丽有着一头橙褐色的头发，优雅的造型与她的古典审美相得益彰。她穿着一件奶油色的连衣裙，上面饰有精致的波点图案，搭配彼得潘领和配套的鞋子。娃娃周围环绕着一些与主题相呼应的微型配饰，包括精致的茶具（茶壶、茶杯和茶碟）、蕾丝手帕和一小束珍珠，这些配饰可能象征着高雅的品味和古朴的传统。此外，还有一幅浮雕肖像，镶嵌在一个优雅的金色装饰画框中——唤起维多利亚时代或爱德华时代的氛围——以及一个蕾丝玫瑰花结。整体呈现强调精致、怀旧和女性气质，柔和的米色调与包装的设计美感相得益彰。“艾米丽”的名字以粗体衬线字体醒目地显示在顶部，更增添了永恒的韵味。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 479, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 291, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "bbda5e52ad580c13ceaa53136d9c2bed9137bd2e", "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 27}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "prompt opt", "links": [484], "label": "prompt opt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt opt"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [588.9691162109375, 1939.913330078125], "widgets_values": ["沙滩上的女孩", 1742, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 483, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 314, "type": "RH_Prompter", "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "RH_Prompter"}, "order": 29}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "STRING", "links": [485], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [683.100830078125, 154.2476806640625], "pos": [820.8846435546875, 1906.7850341796875], "widgets_values": [["zhz,Quhan Emoticon Pack,This is a four-frame 3D animation character expression combination table. The expressions are exaggerated and vivid, the characters always have black eyes, and the expressions are combined with actions: thinking seriously, opening the mouth in surprise, blushing and smiling shyly, angry and irritable, evenly distributed, equal in size, and with a unified background.The character has long, dark, wavy hair flowing naturally in the breeze. They are wearing a brown plaid jacket and have a thin gold chain-style shoulder strap visible. The background shows a bright blue sky with scattered white clouds, along with people walking outdoors in casual attire. A rooftop setting is implied, with a distant view of city structures and open space."], "图片展示了一个名为“厨房时光”的迷人收藏娃娃，呈现出一种现代与随性相结合的独特风格。这个娃娃有着一头微卷的长发，散发出自然的柔美气息。她穿着一件灰色背心，搭配浅蓝色破洞牛仔裤，展现出休闲又时尚的造型。她的手中持着一张报纸，优雅地覆盖在胸前，仿佛在传达一种随性与自信的态度。她的手腕上佩戴了一款银色手镯，为整体造型增添了一丝精致的点缀。\n\n背景设计为一个温馨的厨房场景，细节丰富且充满生活气息。周围摆放着酒瓶等道具，营造出一种真实而熟悉的家庭氛围。厨房的色调温暖柔和，与娃娃的服饰形成和谐的对比。整体设计强调了现代女性的独立与随性，同时也展现了日常生活中的简单美好。“厨房时光”的名字以简洁的字体显示在包装顶部，突出了这一主题的亲切与现代感。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 484, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 320, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "bbda5e52ad580c13ceaa53136d9c2bed9137bd2e", "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 31}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 3, "name": "MODEL", "slot_index": 0, "links": [494], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"shape": 3, "name": "CLIP", "slot_index": 1, "links": [495], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["FLUX-3D-GPT-4o-v1.safetensors", 0.20000000000000004, 0.20000000000000004], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 421, "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}, {"name": "clip", "link": 422, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIPCLIP"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoraLoader", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [320, 130], "pos": [-495.3161926269531, 1546